# Line-ending policy — prevents the Windows CRLF trap for files the container executes.
# `eol=lf` forces LF at checkout on every platform (overrides git `core.autocrlf`),
# so shell shebangs stay valid inside the Linux image. (See 2026-09-23 incident:
# `exec /entrypoint.sh: no such file or directory` on Windows hosts with autocrlf=true.)
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
